# 團隊含 Windows 使用者:文字檔一律以 LF 進版控,避免 CRLF 汙染 diff 與
# zip 內容(zip 打包的位元組差異會讓 sha 基準失效)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.gitattributes text eol=lf
*.gitignore text eol=lf

# 二進位:不做行尾轉換、不嘗試 diff
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
